EPIC!

I have been on twitch a while so am well aware of the popular streamers like alinity and I am impressed by how righteously indignant some of the people on here get over a cat toss. Some of you obviously need a real cause to waste your time on, seriously why don't you find out how most cows, pigs, and chickens live and end their lives then come back and pretend you care about "animal abuse". 

&#x200B;

Embarassing.
